ClashNl for Apple platforms
===========================

This directory is a modified distribution of sing-box-for-apple and links a
modified sing-box Libbox framework. The upstream projects are Copyright (C)
SagerNet contributors and licensed under GNU General Public License version 3
or later.

Upstream sources:
  https://github.com/SagerNet/sing-box-for-apple
  https://github.com/SagerNet/sing-box

The client license is in LICENSE. The pinned core's license notice, including
its naming/association condition, is preserved in LICENSES/sing-box.txt.

ClashNl adds an original Clash/Mihomo YAML compatibility layer, independent
branding, profile import integration, and first-run privacy disclosures.
Changes are distributed under the same GPL terms. Paid distribution does not
remove recipients' rights to obtain, study, modify, and redistribute the
corresponding source.

